@startuml authorisation-screen-flow
' Screen flow — authorise a TPP request (consent or payment). PROPOSAL, AI.
' Three surfaces (SRC-ADR): the IDP login screen, the consent screen (managed by the Bank ASPSP)
' and the SCA screen in the bank app, presented by the CIAM on the enrolled device, where the PSU
' confirms his identity. Where a payment's amount and payee are shown is not defined (Q-46, Q-48).
' Screens (SCR-*) and read models (RM-*) are defined in docs/journeys/service-blueprint.md.
title Authorise a TPP request — screens, managing component, read model

state "SCR-TPP-REQUEST\n<i>TPP</i>" as TppReq
state "Redirect token valid?" as Link <<choice>>
state "SCR-CONSENT-UNAVAILABLE\n<i>CMP-CONSENT-SCREEN · RM-REDIRECT-SESSION</i>" as Unavailable
state "SCR-IDP-LOGIN\n<i>CMP-PING — login screen, in the browser</i>" as Login
state "Purpose" as Purpose <<choice>>
state "SCR-CONSENT-ACCESS\n<i>CMP-CONSENT-SCREEN · RM-CONSENT-APPROVAL</i>" as Access
state "Enrolled device?" as HasDevice <<choice>>
state "SCR-CONSENT-NO-DEVICE\n<i>CMP-CONSENT-SCREEN — unscheduled, Q-21 / Q-49</i>" as NoDevice #line.dashed
state "Strong customer authentication" as SCA {
  state "SCR-CONSENT-AWAIT-APP\n<i>browser · CMP-CONSENT-SCREEN · RM-AUTHORISATION-OUTCOME</i>" as Await
  state "SCR-APP-SCA\n<i>bank app · CMP-MOBILE-APP · RM-SCA-PROMPT</i>" as AppSca
  Await -right-> AppSca : the CIAM presents the SCA screen\non an enrolled device
}
state "SCR-CONSENT-OUTCOME\n<i>CMP-CONSENT-SCREEN · RM-AUTHORISATION-OUTCOME</i>" as Outcome
state "SCR-TPP-RESULT\n<i>TPP · RM-TPP-CONSENT-STATUS / RM-TPP-PAYMENT-STATUS</i>" as TppResult

[*] --> TppReq
TppReq --> Link : follow scaRedirect
Link --> Login : open, SCA window open
Link --> Unavailable : unknown / expired / used
Login --> Purpose : authenticated
Login --> Outcome : failed / cancelled
Purpose --> Access : consent
Purpose --> HasDevice : payment — no browser\napproval page (Q-46, Q-48)
Access --> HasDevice : approve
Access --> Outcome : decline
HasDevice --> SCA : yes
HasDevice --> NoDevice : no
SCA --> Outcome : confirmed / rejected /\ntimed out (Q-29)
Outcome --> TppResult : "Back to ⟨TPP⟩"\n(Redirect-URI or Nok-URI)
Unavailable --> TppResult : "Back to ⟨TPP⟩" (Nok-URI)
TppResult --> [*]

note right of Outcome
  Outcome screen versus immediate return is open (Q-39).
  WS-01 returns immediately; MVP-01 proposes this screen.
end note
note left of Access
  Partial approval — Q-36. Account not held — Q-35.
end note
note bottom of SCA
  Open (Q-46): for a payment, no surface here is defined
  as showing the amount and payee, which dynamic linking
  requires (INV-AUT-05, UX-01, UX-09).
end note
@enduml
